{"id":"8d335d3011844c5a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-optional-stopping.md","title":"Optional Stopping Theorem","display":"thm-optional-stopping — Optional Stopping Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-optional-stopping","aliases":["58-thm-optional-stopping"],"display":"thm-optional-stopping — Optional Stopping Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-stopping-time]]","[[58-df-martingale]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-expectation]]","[[58-df-L1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-optional-stopping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-optional-stopping</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-optional-stopping — Optional Stopping Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f1cc8d467081eb6\" href=\"?note=5f1cc8d467081eb6\" title=\"58-df-stopping-time\">58-df-stopping-time</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"58-df-expectation\">58-df-expectation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec5f34b0092e1daf\" href=\"?note=ec5f34b0092e1daf\" title=\"58-df-L1\">58-df-L1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_n),\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_n),\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (filtered probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\bullet,\\tau,Z\\in V\">\\(M_\\bullet,\\tau,Z\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded martingale, bounded stopping time, and stopped-value representative)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\)</span> (martingale predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))\">\\(\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))\\)</span> (stopping-time predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5f1cc8d467081eb6\" href=\"?note=5f1cc8d467081eb6\" title=\"58-df-stopping-time\">58-df-stopping-time</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\\)</span> (bounded stopping-time predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\\)</span> (stopped-value predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S\\)</span> (integrable representative predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ec5f34b0092e1daf\" href=\"?note=ec5f34b0092e1daf\" title=\"58-df-L1\">58-df-L1</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\tau(x)\\leq N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\Omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\tau(x)\\leq N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(Z,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(Z(x)=M_{\\tau(x)}(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(Z,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(Z(x)=M_{\\tau(x)}(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}optional\\text{-}stopping} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(M_\\bullet,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(M_\\bullet))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(M_n;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists Z,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e,Z;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e,M_0;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}optional\\text{-}stopping} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(M_\\bullet,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(M_\\bullet))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(M_n;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedStoppingTime}_S(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists Z,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StoppedVariable}_S(Z,M_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e,Z;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e,M_0;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>, the stopped process <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_{n\\wedge\\tau})_n\">\\((M_{n\\wedge\\tau})_n\\)</span> is a martingale and the expectation identity follows.</li>\n<li>The stopped random variable and the common expectation value are explicit witnesses; neither an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1\">\\(L^1\\)</span> class nor an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\tau\">\\(M_\\tau\\)</span> term is evaluated pointwise.</li>\n<li>Unbounded stopping times require additional hypotheses such as uniform integrability or suitable domination/increment bounds.</li>\n<li>This is fundamental in stochastic calculus.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stopping-time","status":"resolved","id":"5f1cc8d467081eb6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stopping-time]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-L1","status":"resolved","id":"ec5f34b0092e1daf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-L1]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)$ (martingale predicate, see [[58-df-martingale]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stopping-time","status":"resolved","id":"5f1cc8d467081eb6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))$ (stopping-time predicate, see [[58-df-stopping-time]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-L1","status":"resolved","id":"ec5f34b0092e1daf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S$ (integrable representative predicate, see [[58-df-L1]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_n),\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"M_\\bullet,\\tau,Z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StoppingTime}(\\tau,(\\mathcal F_n))","display":false},{"tex":